* ============================================================================
* 16_locus_mechanism.do — Table 3 Baron-Kenny mediation (P4 bank_fintech_locus)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Plan: §5.5.2 P4 mechanism — Baron-Kenny 1986 + Imai-Keele-Tingley 2010
*
*   X (locus pair) = locus_layer_full / locus_scenario_full
*   M (mediator)   = capex_it (primary) / r_and_d_intensity (secondary, R9-m02)
*   Y (outcome)    = {{MAIN_DV}}    (= citation_weighted_patent, Kogan 2017 谱系; car_5day_window 降级上市行扩展) + patent_fintech_count (secondary)
*
* 中介假说: locus_layer → 更高 capex_it / R&D 投入 → 更高专利产出 + CAR。
* 白话: 检验"押注底层技术的银行 → 加大 IT/研发投入 → 专利和股价反应更好"这条因果链是否成立。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* Step 1: 总效应 Y ~ X (layer)
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo total_layer

* Step 2: a 路径 capex_it ~ locus
capture confirm variable capex_it
if !_rc {
    reghdfe capex_it locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo apath_capex
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] capex_it not in panel (M0.5.11 CSMAR enrichment pending)"
}

* Step 3: 直接效应路径 Y ~ locus + capex_it
capture confirm variable capex_it
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full capex_it $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo direct_capex
}

* Step 4: 次级中介变量 r_and_d_intensity
capture confirm variable r_and_d_intensity
if !_rc {
    reghdfe r_and_d_intensity locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo apath_rd

    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full r_and_d_intensity $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo direct_rd
}

* Step 5: 以专利产出作替代 outcome
capture confirm variable patent_fintech_count
if !_rc {
    reghdfe patent_fintech_count locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo total_patent
}

* Imai-Keele-Tingley 2010 敏感性分析: medsens (per §5.7.3 SSC install)
* ssc install medsens, replace
* medsens, sims(1000) rho(-0.5 0.5)

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — apath_capex/direct_capex/
* apath_rd/direct_rd/total_patent 全在守卫块内 (capex_it 等 CSMAR enrichment 列缺失
* 即跳过), 旧版硬点名缺名 → r(111) 丢整表 (total_layer 实际可估也一并丢)。
qui estimates dir
local models `r(names)'
esttab `models' ///
    using "$tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("Table 3 — Mechanism (P4 locus → R&D / IT capex → patent + CAR)") ///
    addnotes("Mediator pair: capex_it (primary, CSMAR) + r_and_d_intensity (secondary, 国家专利局)." ///
             "Sobel z + Imai, Keele \& Yamamoto 2010 sensitivity in medsens.log.")

* fix(omni-g-esttab-csv, 2026-06-11): CSV side-channel — papers/bank_fintech_locus/
* tables.py:build_table3_mechanism 经 read_paper_esttab(..., 'table3_mechanism.csv') 消费。
estout `models' using "$tables_dir/table3_mechanism.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
    starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01)

display "[OK] Table 3 (mechanism) → $tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"
